    "https://careers.westfield.ma.edu/": {
      "title": "Career Center",
      "description": "Career Center | Westfield State University Class of 2025, take our Post-Graduate Outcomes Survey to let us know where you landed after WSU! Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Career Center Instagram LinkedIn Pinterest X (formerly Twitter) YouTube Schedule an Appointment Donate Students & Alumni Explore Career Pathways Discovery & Exploration Job Trends & Salaries Arts, Media, Marketing & Communications Business Management Counseling & Social Justice Criminal Justice, Government & Law Education Finance & Accounting Health & Fitness Information Technology Science & Math Additional Resources for Students Job Boards, Networking & Career Support Employers Employer Sponsorship Register for a Career Fair Recruiting Options Faculty & Staff Career Champions Prospective Students WSU Career Fairs & Events Meet the Team Case Study Opportunities. Build Valuable Career Skills through Forage! Law, Business, Data Analysis, Health Care Studies & More! Upcoming Events March Mar 02 Event: USPS Hiring Event Portsmouth NH -every Monday Mon, Mar 2 at 10am - Mon, Sep 28 at 4pm Monday, March 2nd at 10am - Monday, September 28th at 4pm April Apr 03 Event: USPS Hiring Event Portland ME every Friday Fri, Apr 3 at 10am - Fri, Sep 25 at 4pm Friday, April 3rd at 10am - Friday, September 25th at 4pm September Sep 04 Event: Register Here: 2026 SMBC Explore (for College Sophomores) Fri, Sep 4 from 10am - 4pm Friday, September 4th from 10am - 4pm Sep 08 Event: GWI Ask Admissions: Open Q&A Session Tue, Sep 8 from 4pm - 4:45pm Tuesday, September 8th from 4pm - 4:45pm Sep 08 Event: Meet the Business - Wealth, U.S. Consumer Cards & Services (North America Session) Tue, Sep 8 from 5pm - 5:45pm Tuesday, September 8th from 5pm - 5:45pm Sep 08 Event: Kraft Heinz 101: Session 1 Tue, Sep 8 from 5pm - 6pm Tuesday, September 8th from 5pm - 6pm Sep 08 Event: Ankura Consulting - Ankura Office of the CFO® Virtual Information Session Tue, Sep 8 from 6pm - 7pm Tuesday, September 8th from 6pm - 7pm Sep 08 Event: Unlock Your Future: Banking Analyst Internships in Japan (North America) Tue, Sep 8 from 7pm - 8pm Tuesday, September 8th from 7pm - 8pm Sep 09 Event: McKenney's Career Fair Prep Workshop! Wed, Sep 9 from 10am - 10:30am Wednesday, September 9th from 10am - 10:30am Sep 09 Event: Future in 15- Discover M&T Bank! Wed, Sep 9 from 10am - 10:15am Wednesday, September 9th from 10am - 10:15am See more events Access Handshake On-Campus Employment CareerSpots Videos Outcomes Data Request a Presentation Job Trends & Salaries Contact & Location Phone 413-572-5206 Email careers@westfield.ma.edu Website https://careers.westfield.ma.edu/ Address Westfield State University Parenzo Hall, 130 577 Western Avenue Westfield, MA 01086 Career Service Hours Day of the week Hours of Operation Summer Hours M Monday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm T Tuesday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm W Wednesday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm TH Thursday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm F Friday 8:30 am- 4:30 pm 8:00 am- 4:00 pm Meet the Team Junior Delgado Meet Junior Giselle Frechette Meet Giselle Dino Innarelli Meet Dino Sharon Welch Meet Sharon Lori Putnam Meet Lori Chelsea Rose-Dunham Meet Chelsea Sarah Kraft Meet Sarah Phone 413-572-5206 Email careers@westfield.ma.edu Website https://careers.westfield.ma.edu/ Address Westfield State University Parenzo Hall, 130 577 Western Avenue Westfield, MA 01086 Footer Column 1 Alumni Connections Events Experiences Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Organizations Resources Meet the Team Instagram LinkedIn Pinterest X (formerly Twitter) YouTube Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Westfield State University"
